parkComment(classification, label):
```
h(3) '🅿️ Provider Quota Exhausted — lane parked'
The AI development leg cannot proceed: provider <b>z.ai</b> reports a hard quota wall (<window> usage limit, HTTP 403). Unlike a transient rate limit, retrying cannot succeed until the quota window resets.

The ticket (and its PR, if any) is parked with label `provider_quota`:
- NOT reset to Ready For Development — dispatch lanes skip this ticket while the label is present.
- Retries resume when the quota window resets — the SM runs a bounded probe (one cheap provider ping every N ticks) and lifts the park automatically on success.
- A human can un-park immediately by removing the `provider_quota` label (e.g. after reconfiguring the provider).
```

